"Its proper name is the Interdimensional Warrior's Contract; most people just say the System."
"The Artonans brought it to Earth in 1963, making Earth an Artonan resource world."
"It chooses about 0.07% of people as Avowed, most between fifteen and seventeen."
"The System speaks only to the Avowed, by an interface in their sight and a voice in their ears."
"A civilian can reach the System only by phone, through the Avowed Communications Network."
"Words spoken aloud to the air by someone not Avowed reach nothing; the System does not answer."
"No one else can see an Avowed's interface."
